{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/2647e578546058f786539a6d8980a4c0.avif?t=1763149643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras_big/2647e578546058f786539a6d8980a4c0.webp?t=1763149643 width=1560 height=797 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark West is an Action RPG that challenges both your skill and sanity. Face the cursed frontier, where faith and damnation war beneath the eternal dusk. Every choice carves a path through a world of filth where greed unearthed something fouler than death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/9ee89bf635accc8c71f6392416f612db.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1200 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive visceral, high-stakes combat where every hit matters. Using every weapon at your disposal to tear through hordes of twisted foes. In this wasteland, it's kill or be killed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/8ef1f86873920f9e4631ad3c54eaf949.poster.avif?t=1763149643\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/8ef1f86873920f9e4631ad3c54eaf949.webm?t=1763149643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/8ef1f86873920f9e4631ad3c54eaf949.mp4?t=1763149643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/e45723e707a925ea6a5b3e247392c443.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1197 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaze your trail by forging a build from the trove of treasures, honing masterful skills, and learning frontier-born tricks that turn your character into something feared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/79508d589840763b51b9fbae1db4168e.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1197 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into a dying town, where the land is tainted by black magic. This curse does not grant power, it demands it, and at a cost no man should pay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/93c0b3b1be0adc3f47d2765c695e5a3a.poster.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/93c0b3b1be0adc3f47d2765c695e5a3a.webm?t=1763149643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/93c0b3b1be0adc3f47d2765c695e5a3a.mp4?t=1763149643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/77f36034cec714166cbed2de89d21981.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1200 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two sides rise in the ruin: <strong>The Order</strong>, zealots cloaked in justice, blind to the rot in their ranks.\u00a0 <strong>The Damned</strong>, cursed souls lost to black magic\u2019s grip. In this land, trust is a slow death. The real danger isn\u2019t what waits in the dark, it\u2019s who\u2019s standing behind you when the killing starts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Steeped in Shadow:</strong> Explore the cursed town, a gritty frontier filled with grim secrets and vile abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gothic western filled with twisted horror where hope is a sickness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, Dark Progression:</strong> Customize your character with dynamic skills and impactful itemization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal ARPG Combat:</strong> Fast-paced, strategic, and unforgiving. Every encounter is a fight to the death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/37f5333f7ba1a1333dabbc991681ff03.avif?t=1763149643\" width=1560 height=170 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Only the strongest, the most cunning, and the most ruthless will endure. Face off against monstrosities, duel desperados at the edges of the world, and ride through unforgiving frontiers where the dead don\u2019t always stay buried. The Dark West does not forgive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/22961e819bb001ea7a2d0ec221975b21.avif?t=1763149643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras_big/22961e819bb001ea7a2d0ec221975b21.webp?t=1763149643 width=1560 height=715 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574750?t=1763149643","background_r