 of the world, and ride through unforgiving frontiers where the dead don\u2019t always stay buried. The Dark West does not forgive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras/22961e819bb001ea7a2d0ec221975b21.avif?t=1763149643\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/extras_big/22961e819bb001ea7a2d0ec221975b21.webp?t=1763149643 width=1560 height=715 /></span></p>","developers":["Black Hand"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574750/b5f6fa311691ec47f96f0c88624c0bce8e52121d/header.jpg?t=1763149643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574750/855180/41b216aa872282e26597d996d4aca810374b4d2a/1750469619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763149349","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574750/855180/41b216aa872282e26597d996d4aca810374b4d2a/1750469619/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763149349","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3574750/855180/41b216aa872282e26597d996d4aca810374b4d2a/1750469619/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763149349","id":257116992,"name":"The Dark West Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116992/edf13410d6265eaec546d8533c419453758efdd9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763149349"}],"name":"The Dark West","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 core 2.8GHz x64-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeFor